        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Macaco de Grama. Pansage oferece a folha de sua cabeça a Pokémon que parecem cansados, pois ela alivia o estresse. Ele é habilidoso para encontrar frutas, coleta-as por toda parte e as compartilha gentilmente com os amigos.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Pansage pode evoluir para Simisage no nível 8 ou superior, com a ajuda de uma Leaf Stone. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Play Nice, Scratch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Leer</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Lick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Vine Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Fury Swipes</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Leech Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Seed Bomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Torment</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Fling</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Acrobatics</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Grass Knot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Recycle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Natural Gift</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Crunch</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Attract, Confide, Covet, Double Team, Endeavor, Energy Ball, Facade, Fling, Focus Punch, Frustration, Gastro Acid, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grass Pledge, Gunk Shot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Nature Power, Payback, Protect, Recycle, Rest, Return, Rock Tomb, Role Play, Round, Seed Bomb, Shadow Claw, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Synthesis, Taunt, Thief, Torment, Toxic, Uproar, Work Up, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Astonish, Bullet Seed, Covet, Disarming Voice, Grass Whistle, Leaf Storm, Low Kick, Magical Leaf, Nasty Plot, Role Play, Spiky Shield, Tickle</p>",
